baseFractionField -- extracts the fraction field of the base polynomial ring of a Weyl algebra
**********************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        baseFractionField D
  * Inputs:
      * D, a Weyl algebra, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note fraction field: (Macaulay2Doc)FractionField,, the fraction
        field of the base polynomial ring of D

Description
===========

Several functions in this package return an object over the fraction field of
the base polynomial ring of a Weyl algebra. This function extracts that ring.

+-------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : D = makeWeylAlgebra(frac(QQ[e])[a,b,c, DegreeRank => 0][x,y]);|
+-------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : baseFractionField D                                           |
|                                                                   |
|o2 = frac(QQ[x..y, a..c, e])                                       |
|                                                                   |
|o2 : FractionField                                                 |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : gens oo                                                       |
|                                                                   |
|o3 = {x, y, a, b, c, e}                                            |
|                                                                   |
|o3 : List                                                          |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------+

Ways to use baseFractionField:
==============================

  * "baseFractionField(FractionField)"
  * "baseFractionField(PolynomialRing)"

